hmm...

see if you can boot it in 'Fail safe boot' mode. It involves placing a
jumper on the motherboard and having a disk with the SRM image on it in
the floppy drive. I can look up the jumper, but I don't have my manual
handy at the moment.

if the flash is messed up, it should just pull the image from the floppy,
and from there you can flash the ROM again.

Kurt


