if you're not getting a blue screen w/ a flashing cursor, then you need to
follow the fail safe boot.

If it is blue, wait a while and hit CNTRL-Z a couple of times and / or
enter

that should wake the thing up to realize it's on a normal console

then at the '>>' prompt type 'set console graphics' and you shouldn't have
a problem again.

Kurt


