> With Option"SWcursor", the problem still persisted, but seems to have been 
> solved once I used the "no_accel" option (in addition) . The system is a 
> compute server and fast graphics is preferable, but not terribly important.

Well, "no_accel" turns off *all* acceleration. so it's probably not too
surprising that that solves the problem... ;-}

I guess, if you don't need it to be fast, that's a reasonable quick
solution.

> Will need to download 4.2.0 and try. kind of slow with a dial-up connection :-(

Yikes! I guess I'd go with "no_accel" and wait for RPMS... :-\

--Jay++

