On Wed, Jan 23, 2002 at 02:27:27PM -0500, Terry A. Bowling wrote:
>
> Sorry, I figured out question 1.  I have 32 bit pci slots and 64 bit pci
> slots.  I put the Elsa card into the same 64 bit slot that I took the
> 3D30 card out of and I got the error below.  If I put the Elsa into a
> 32bit slot, SRM comes up with no problems.

32-bit slots are behind a bridge, so will be slower.

SRM should be OK with ELSA card, IF it is the latest SRM. If it IS, and
you STILL have a problem, type in to SRM:

	>>> set pci_device_override -1

and try again.

--Jay++

