need to replace the RH7.1 boot because I use legacy address)
    what make options must I run, vs what ones might I run?
    Is it normal/safe/correct to simply reboot by specifying the
alternate kernel in the ARC bios, or should I also be doing anything
else?
  =20
Luke
=20
=20
=20
  =20
=20

