unix (or whatever is right for SRM and Linux) or I would
have seen it try to go to AlphaBIOS after reset.  Linux
boots and works okay (except for a few XFree86 vs. VX1
issues).

Hardware is a UP2000, one 667MHz CPU, 32MB Oxygen VX1
card, plus a bunch of other PCI cards.

Software is RH7.1 updated to kernel 2.4.9-21 and XFree86
