Hi,
I didn't want to write as I don't know the exact answer. But as nobody else 
answered, here we go:
 you can add to your kernel-options something like
"cycle=500000000", where the 5*10^8 is the clock-rate of the processor. Now 
for the word "cycle", it should be element of {cycle, cycles, clock, 
counter}. This is why I didn't write in first time...

Greets

Ineiti

