I purchased an IntraServer card for my 164SX a couple of years ago.
They were even advertised as being for Alphas.  Still working great, and
I went out of my way to buy DEC drives (I have an RZ29B-VW and an
RZ2DD-LS, both from EBay and ripped out of their SBBs so I could use
them internally). Unfortunately, LSI bought IntraServer, so it may not
be as easy to find as it was for me...  Although, after looking at their
web page
(http://www.lsilogic.com/products/storage_standard_prod/hba/scsi/ultra2_
scsi/index.html), it looks like they still have Alpha-compatable
products.

