be careful...  depending on rev of the boards, SRM might see the drives but
wont boot correctly...  this is more of a problem for OSF (DUNIX) than for
Linux.

i've seen that problem in the early days when Qlogic boards were being
introduced into the alpha family.

in some of the brand spanking newer motherboards, Adaptec (7885?) is fully
supported under OSF and SRM.


